        {
          "title": "AlgoPilot: Cross-Paradigm Reasoning in Language Models via Strategy Selection and Guidance",
          "title_zh": "AlgoPilot：通过策略选择与引导实现语言模型的跨范式推理",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2611.04079v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2611.04079",
          "summary": "AlgoPilot trains a SteerLM to select a problem-solving paradigm and mode, a GuideLM to produce structured formulation guidance for that choice, and an ExecutionLM to solve the problem conditioned on both. Built on Qwen3-8B, it raises average accuracy across 13 benchmarks and 66 domains from 38.4% to 72.9% and beats the best large-LLM prompting baseline, GLM-5, by 11.7%.",
