          "title": "Modular and Efficient Approximate Nearest Neighbors Search with Vectorium and kANNolo",
          "title_zh": "Vectorium 与 kANNolo：模块化高效的近似最近邻搜索",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2611.03927v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "tools_frameworks",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2611.03927",
          "summary": "Vectorium and kANNolo are open-source Rust libraries that separate vector data management from indexing, supporting dense, sparse and multi-vector representations with 11 encoders and generic HNSW, IVF and two-stage indexes. The authors report state-of-the-art memory-throughput trade-offs, matching Faiss product quantization in accuracy at competitive speed and outperforming Faiss IVF on their benchmarks.",
